<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">5.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;</FONT><B><U>Employee&rsquo;s Acknowledgments</U>.</B> <I>This Agreement is an important legal document, and Employee is hereby advised
to consult with an attorney of Employee&rsquo;s choosing before entering into this Agreement</I>. By executing and delivering this Release,
